# Agent notes (prior chat context)

Useful agent notes for specific issues in this codebase live in **`/agent-notes`**.

These are write-ups from previous chats that capture debugging context, timing research, gotchas, and other non-obvious findings. When investigating a bug, odd behavior, or an area that looks like it was already worked through:

1. Check `agent-notes/` for a relevant note before rediscovering the same ground.
2. Prefer those notes as starting context; verify against current code if things may have changed.
3. If you resolve a sticky issue that future agents will hit again, consider adding a short note there.
